# gstack

gstack is installed at `/opt/gstack` (baked into the environment image, not a per-session install).

## How to run a gstack skill

Do **not** improvise from memory or from AGENTS.md. To run a gstack skill:

1. Read `/opt/gstack/<name>/SKILL.md`
2. Follow that file exactly

Use `/opt/gstack/browse/dist/browse` for all web browsing required by gstack skills.

## Available skills

| Skill | Path |
| --- | --- |
| office-hours | `/opt/gstack/office-hours/SKILL.md` |
| autoplan | `/opt/gstack/autoplan/SKILL.md` |
| review | `/opt/gstack/review/SKILL.md` |
| qa | `/opt/gstack/qa/SKILL.md` |
| cso | `/opt/gstack/cso/SKILL.md` |
| ship | `/opt/gstack/ship/SKILL.md` |
| investigate | `/opt/gstack/investigate/SKILL.md` |
| document-release | `/opt/gstack/document-release/SKILL.md` |

Slash commands like `/qa` mean: read and follow `/opt/gstack/qa/SKILL.md` (and likewise for the other names above).
